<Positioned left="80" top="936"><Text fontSize="14" color="#6E7F8C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">深度 200（上）→ 1,000 m（下）（示意，非同比）</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="660" top="300" width="300" height="200"><Container width="300" height="200" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="10" border="1 SOLID #D8CDB5" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="682" top="320"><Text fontSize="18" color="#2FA79E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">地球上最大的迁徙</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="682" top="354" width="256"><Text fontSize="15" color="#16293B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">浮游动物的每日垂直移动被称为『地球上最大的迁徙』，也影响全局气候</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="682" top="468"><Text fontSize="14" color="#B08430" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">[S10]</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="660" top="524" width="300" height="168"><Container width="300" height="168" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="10" border="1 SOLID #D8CDB5" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="682" top="544"><Text fontSize="18" color="#2FA79E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">灯为什么在天上</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="682" top="578" width="256"><Text fontSize="15" color="#16293B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">开始出现生物发光；鱼眼普遍变大且朝上，好借背影捕猎</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="682" top="660"><Text fontSize="14" color="#B08430" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">[S22]</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="660" top="716" width="300" height="168"><Container width="300" height="168" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="10" border="1 SOLID #D8CDB5" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="682" top="736"><Text fontSize="18" color="#2FA79E" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">光还能勉强进来</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="682" top="770" width="256"><Text fontSize="15" color="#16293B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">200 m 外几乎不再有实际光照；水色仍可辨识，1,000 m 到达光的检出限</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="682" top="852"><Text fontSize="14" color="#B08430" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">[S02]</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="1020" width="880" height="118"><Container width="880" height="118" color="#FFF9E6" borderRadius="10" border="1 SOLID #E2D3AC" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="84" top="1042"><Text fontSize="16" color="#8A6A1C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">官方表述引用（原文）</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="84" top="1074" width="832"><Text fontSize="14" color="#8A6A1C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">「As the greatest migration on Earth」——NOAA Ocean Exploration 对这一现象的定性（zooplankton 构成主体）</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="60" top="1156" width="880" height="128"><Container width="880" height="128" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="10" border="1 SOLID #D8CDB5" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="82" top="1176"><Text fontSize="18" color="#B08430" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">感觉尺（自行计算）</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="82" top="1210" width="836"><Text fontSize="15" color="#16293B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">800 m 高差 ≈ 上海中心式高楼再加约 168 m</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="82" top="1252"><Text fontSize="14" color="#B08430" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">[calc]</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="0" top="1342" width="1000" height="58"><Container width="1000" height="58" color="#EBE1CC" /></Positioned>
<Positioned left="24" top="1360" width="640"><Text fontSize="15" color="#7C8B98" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">下一站 1,000 m：光正式谢幕</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="680" top="1360"><Text fontSize="15" color="#B08430" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">[S02 / S10 / S22]</Text></Positioned>
